# Sarkhan's "whenever a Dragon you control enters" trigger is on the stack when Bot2 Lightning Bolts Sarkhan (a 2/2): he dies, and
# the trigger then resolves with no Sarkhan to put the counter on or to become a Dragon, so it does nothing (CR 608.2b,
# 400.7). Nova Hellkite, cast for its warp cost on turn 3, is unaffected and Bot1 keeps his Treasure.

